{"availability":"available","full":"deekshitha2706/smart-commute","name":"smart-commute","description":"Smart Commute is a smart navigation and traffic-aware route planning system that helps users find routes using real-time location and map services. It aims to improve commuting through destination search, traffic information, alternative route selection, and interactive map views for a more convenient travel experience.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T05:42:51Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:12:05Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://smart-commute-ntqn.onrender.com","topics":[],"demo":"https://smart-commute-ntqn.onrender.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.555Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.555Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.555Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:49.555Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Probabilistic Urban Traffic Congestion and Travel-Time Risk Assessment System — Hyderabad","SmartCommute is a map-first traffic intelligence app. Pick a start and a destination, press Analyze route, and it answers one question:","What is the probability that I will be late if I leave at this time?"],"features":["Map-first interface (Leaflet): glass-style planner, animated route with a moving vehicle, congestion-coloured roads, risk gauge and result card.","Statistics engine: distribution fitting (Normal, Lognormal, Gamma, Weibull by AIC/BIC), weather/hour regression, confidence intervals, risk score, recommended departure time, Monte Carlo simulation.","Map styles: Road, Satellite, Terrain, Hybrid, each with fallback tile providers and correct attribution.","Live location: device position via the browser Geolocation API, with moving marker and true accuracy circle. Never fakes GPS; \"Simulate drive\" and \"I am here\" are labelled not GPS.","Traffic rerouting: alternative roads (OSRM), each ana